{"id": "en_tsunami_p2", "total": 63.69, "segments": [{"text": "Part two. The heavy rooftop access door slams shut behind Max and locks automatically from the outside.", "start": 0.0, "end": 5.42}, {"text": "He pulls the metal handle with all his strength, but the locked door does not budge an inch.", "start": 5.98, "end": 9.64}, {"text": "Max does not panic because he remembers the most important safety rules for this terrifying night.", "start": 10.42, "end": 14.18}, {"text": "One. Waves can keep coming for hours, so he must stay high up until officials say it is safe.", "start": 14.74, "end": 19.18}, {"text": "He steps back from the jammed door and finds a sheltered corner away from the howling wind.", "start": 19.84, "end": 23.18}, {"text": "Two. The first wave is often not the biggest, and more surging water violently slams the ground below.", "start": 23.82, "end": 28.64}, {"text": "Max watches the dark ocean from the high concrete roof while the dangerous floodwaters swirl in the streets.", "start": 28.64, "end": 33.54}, {"text": "Three. He waits patiently on the rooftop platform as hours pass slowly in the pitch black night.", "start": 34.18, "end": 39.04}, {"text": "Sirens wail in the distance and emergency lights sweep across the dark skyline of the coastal town.", "start": 39.74, "end": 43.74}, {"text": "A rescue team finally arrives on the roof with master keys and checks the secure perimeter.", "start": 44.54, "end": 47.94}, {"text": "They unlock the heavy metal door and guide Max safely down the stairs to dry ground.", "start": 48.46, "end": 52.072}, {"text": "He survived the disaster by trusting his feet, moving fast, and climbing high.", "start": 52.22, "end": 55.7}, {"text": "Never drive away when the ocean pulls back and always stay high up. Follow for a new scenario tomorrow.", "start": 56.16, "end": 60.54}], "words": [["Part", 0.0, 0.32], ["two.", 0.244, 0.488], ["The", 1.34, 1.42], ["heavy", 1.42, 1.62], ["rooftop", 1.62, 1.98], ["access", 1.98, 